# Stand-in for the build.dist OBS generates from the project prjconf.
#
# auto/config's get_prjconf_parameter() reads /.build/build.dist first, and
# these values drive the ISO volume label, ISO application/publisher, and
# PROJECT_ID -- which becomes the second VYATTA_PROJECT_ID line in
# /etc/os-release and the trailing bracket of "show version".
#
# Keep in step with .obs/prjconf.txt. Getting them out of step is silent: the
# vyatta-version package still carries the OBS value, so "show version" reports
# the new release on the Version: line while the bracket and the ISO label keep
# the old one.
#
# Install into the build container with:
#   docker cp build.dist danos-2110b-build:/.build/build.dist
%_project Kington
%_vyatta_name Disaggregated Network Operating System
%_vyatta_pretty_name DANOS
%_vyatta_version_id 2608
